# Validation

- Treat `validation/SHA256SUMS.txt` and `validation/validation-summary.json` as the kit integrity ledger.
- After material kit file adds/changes, regenerate checksums and refresh the summary counts/status.
- Do not invent a passing status when mismatches remain; record issues instead.
- Prefer regenerating the full checksum set over hand-editing individual hashes.
- Keep validation artifacts free of credentials and environment-specific secrets.
